+	"queued ahead of other pending commands. Every response line arrives as a QuectelAtResponse event\n"
+	"(Line: <text>); the final result arrives as exactly one QuectelAtDone event with\n"
+	"Result: OK | ERROR | TIMEOUT and Error: <text> unless OK. Both events carry the ActionID and\n"
+	"Device of this action. A queue flush (disconnect, reset, restart) ends a pending command with\n"
+	"Result: ERROR. A timeout is reported first and then handled as usual: the modem is\n"
+	"disconnected and restarted.\n\n"
+	"Variables: (Names marked with * are required)\n"
+	"	*ActionID: <id>		1-63 characters [A-Za-z0-9._-]; returned in the response and in the events.\n"
+	"	*Device:   <device>	The Quectel modem that receives the command; must be connected and initialized.\n"
+	"	*Command:  <AT line>	1-256 characters, no CR or LF; sent verbatim followed by CR.\n"
+	"	Timeout:   <seconds>	1-60, default 15; the wait for the final OK/ERROR line.\n"
+	"Errors: Invalid ActionID, Invalid Command, Invalid Timeout, Device not found, Device not connected,\n"
+	"Device not initialized, Queue error.\n"
+	},
 };
 
